<title>USA: DMI Furniture Aug 31 Q4 shr rises.</title>
<headline>DMI Furniture Aug 31 Q4 shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.09		    $0.02</p>
<p> Net		 506			94</p>
<p> Sales	     12,935		   16,824</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,713		    5,654</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.07		    $0.14</p>
<p> Net		 376			804</p>
<p> Sales	     55,563		   67,773</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  5,705		    5,708</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Full company name is DMI Furniture Inc</p>
<p>NOTE: Fourth quarter 1996 net income included a $125,000 gain from the sale of certain assets. Fiscal 1996 results included a $868,000 charge related to the closing of the company's Gettysburg, Pa. operations. The company said profits and margins improved partly because the company sold more higher margin products in the quarter, costs declined, and it consolidated assets successfully.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
